UPDATE companies SET description='1320 Fabrication operates from a shop at 170 Penrod Court in Glen Burnie, Maryland. The founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed, and no founders are named in available sources.

The shop specializes in custom metal fabrication for competition vehicles, with a focus on TIG welding of chromoly, stainless steel, aluminum, and titanium. Services include complete chassis work for hot rods, imports, bracket cars, dragsters, and promods; roll bars and cages built to SFI 25.1–25.5 specifications; mini tubs; stainless steel headers and exhaust systems; custom rear housings; suspension setup and scaling; fuel cell installation; turbo manifolds; intercoolers; carbon fiber components; Lexan windows; race jacks; and JR dragster builds.

Customers come primarily from the drag racing and hot rod segments, including bracket racers, professional drag teams, and JR dragster competitors. The company has a multi-year sponsorship relationship with Maryland International Raceway’s ET Series and was named the Series title sponsor for the Professional Drag Racers Association (PDRA).', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["TIG welding (chromoly, stainless steel, aluminum, titanium)", "Chassis fabrication and repair", "Roll bar and roll cage fabrication (SFI 25.1\u201325.5 spec)", "Mini tub installation", "Stainless steel header and exhaust fabrication", "Custom rear housing fabrication", "Suspension setup and scaling", "Fuel cell installation", "Turbo manifold fabrication", "Intercooler fabrication", "Carbon fiber component fabrication", "Lexan window fabrication", "Race jack fabrication", "JR dragster fabrication", "Custom fabrication"], "industries": ["Drag racing", "Hot rod", "Import racing", "Bracket racing", "Professional drag racing (PDRA)", "JR dragster racing"], "materials": ["Chromoly", "Stainless steel", "Aluminum", "Titanium", "Carbon fiber", "Lexan (polycarbonate)"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["TIG welding of chromoly, stainless steel, aluminum, and titanium", "Roll bars and cages built to SFI 25.1\u201325.5 specifications", "Complete chassis work for hot rods, imports, bracket cars, dragsters, and promods", "Carbon fiber and Lexan component fabrication", "Multi-year sponsorship of Maryland International Raceway ET Series and PDRA Super Street Series"], "facts_used": ["Location: Glen Burnie, Maryland -> db", "Services: TIG welding, chassis work, roll cages, etc. -> /", "Industries: drag racing, hot rod, import racing, bracket racing, PDRA, JR dragster -> /", "Materials: Chromoly, stainless steel, aluminum, titanium, carbon fiber, Lexan -> /", "Partnerships: PDRA 2026 Super Street Series title sponsor, Maryland International R