UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Buckner, Kentucky, 330 Electronics, LLC operates as a U.S.-based electronics manufacturing services provider specializing in flexible PCB assembly for original equipment manufacturers and engineering teams. The company focuses on low-volume, high-mix production runs, offering a responsive alternative to high-volume manufacturers.

Its core services span surface-mount and through-hole PCB assembly, mixed-technology builds, selective and hand soldering, and full turnkey material procurement. Beyond circuit boards, the company delivers box-build integration including sub-assembly, final assembly, cable and harness integration, packaging, and fulfillment. A dedicated division designs and manufactures UL-listed custom temperature control systems, providing rapid prototype PCB fabrication, testing, and system integration.

The customer base includes OEM manufacturers seeking dependable production support, engineering and product development teams transitioning from prototype to production, and operations and supply chain leaders aiming to reduce complexity. Served industries explicitly cited are automotive electronics and renewable energy.

The company emphasizes U.S.-based manufacturing for shorter communication cycles and reduced supply chain uncertainty, an engineering-focused approach that simplifies development-to-production transitions, and scalable solutions tailored to changing requirements. Quality is integrated throughout the process with visual inspection, functional testing, and controlled manufacturing processes.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Surface Mount (SMT)", "Through-Hole Assembly", "Mixed Technology Builds", "Selective and Hand Soldering", "Production Scheduling and Planning", "Turnkey Material Procurement", "Repeat Production Builds", "Visual Inspection and Process Verification", "Functional Testing (as Required)", "Controlled Manufacturing Processes", "Sub-Assembly and Final Assembly", "Cable and Harness Integration", "Product Packaging", "Fulfillment Support", "Custom design and development of electronic control systems", "UL Listed Temperature Control Solutions", "Rapid prototype PCB manufacturing and testing", "System Integration", "Technical Support"], "industries": ["automotive electronics", "renewable energy"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "Prototype to mid-volume production runs", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["U.S.-based manufacturing for shorter communication cycles and reduced supply chain uncertainty", "Engineering-focused approach simplifying prototype-to-production transitions", "Scalable low-volume, high-mix production capabilities", "Integrated quality processes including visual inspection and functional testing", "Responsive partnership with direct communication"], "facts_used": ["Location: Buckner, Kentucky -> db", "Specializes in flexible PCB assembly for OEMs and engineering teams -> db", "Offers SMT, through-hole, mixed technology, selective/hand soldering -> /", "Provides box build integration: sub-assembly, final assembly, cable/harness, packaging, fulfillment -> /", "Offers turnkey material pro