UPDATE companies SET description='A & E Kitchen Service LLC was founded in 2000 in Springfield, Missouri. The company began as a service provider for commercial kitchen equipment, serving customers and manufacturers across the region.

The firm specializes in repair, maintenance, and installation of commercial cooking, preparation, holding, sanitation, refrigeration, warewashing, and HVAC equipment. Its service department fields five technicians, a dispatcher, and a parts manager, and provides factory-authorized warranty coverage for more than 150 equipment brands. Services include preventive maintenance programs, water filtration, start-up, sight surveys, minor construction, electrical, plumbing, and on-site or shop welding.

Customers span restaurants, churches, convenience stores, hospitals, hotels, schools, and other institutions throughout southwest Missouri, including the Springfield, Branson, and Joplin areas.

The company emphasizes its geographic reach and technical depth as a way for clients to consolidate equipment support. It offers 24-hour weekend and emergency service with direct technician contact—no call center—and notes that its factory-trained technicians average at least 15 years of experience in electric, gas, steam, and refrigeration systems.', certifications=ARRAY['Electric certification','Gas certification','Steam certification','Refrigeration certification']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Commercial kitchen equipment repair", "Factory-authorized warranty service", "Installation and removal", "Preventive maintenance programs", "Water filtration", "HVAC service", "Minor construction", "Electrical work", "Plumbing", "On-site welding", "Shop welding", "Start-up", "Sight survey", "24-hour emergency service"], "industries": ["Restaurants", "Churches", "Convenience stores", "Hospitals", "Hotels", "Schools", "Institutions", "Food service"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["24-hour weekend and emergency service", "Factory-authorized warranty service for 150+ manufacturers", "Technicians average 15+ years experience in electric, gas, steam, refrigeration", "Direct technician contact (no call center)", "Service coverage across Springfield, Branson, Joplin areas"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2000 -> db", "Headquarters Springfield, Missouri -> db", "Services commercial cooking, preparation, holding, sanitation, refrigeration, warewashing, HVAC -> /", "Serves restaurants, churches, convenience stores, hospitals, hotels, schools, institutions -> /", "Service area southwest Missouri including Springfield, Branson, Joplin -> /services", "Field service force of 5 technicians, dispatcher, parts manager -> /services", "Factory-authorized warranty service for 150+ manufacturers -> /services", "Technicians certified in electric, gas, steam, refrigeration with average 15 years experience -> /services", "24-hou