UPDATE companies SET description='A1 Graphic & Lettering operates from a 2,500-square-foot facility on the outskirts of Georgetown, Delaware. The company was founded in 2010 by Vic Thomas, who serves as owner and graphic designer, and Sharon Thomas, who oversees embroidery. From the start it has been run as a family-owned, mom-and-pop operation serving the local community and shipping nationwide.

The shop provides custom T-shirt printing, embroidery, sign manufacturing, and direct-to-film (DTF) gang sheets. Vic Thomas handles graphic design in-house, while Sharon Thomas manages the embroidery workflow. The facility supports both small-run and larger orders, with the company noting it has fulfilled uniform packages for youth leagues and embroidered polos for area businesses.

