UPDATE companies SET description='Binford Auto Wrecking operates at 26311 78th Avenue South in Kent, Washington. The business has served the Puget Sound region for more than three decades, originally under the name AAA Auto Wrecking before adopting its current identity. The same location and phone number have been used throughout the transition, and the yard continues to function as a full-service auto salvage operation.

The yard stocks used components from hundreds of cars and trucks, including engines, transmissions, alternators, radiators, wheels, and tires. In addition to parts sales, the company purchases vehicles of all makes and models and offers no-cost pickup for unwanted cars and trucks. Customers can also request pickup or delivery of parts and place special orders for items not currently in stock. Inventory turns over continuously, so the business advises calling ahead with vehicle details to confirm availability.

The operation serves individual vehicle owners, independent repair shops, and other automotive businesses primarily in King and Pierce counties. Its customer base ranges from DIY mechanics looking for affordable replacement parts to professional shops sourcing components for rebuilds and repairs.

The company emphasizes extracting maximum value from every vehicle it processes, a principle reflected in its "More value from every vehicle" messaging. By combining parts sales, vehicle purchasing, and free removal, it aims to provide a convenient, low-cost alternative to new parts and traditional disposal.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Used auto parts sales", "Vehicle purchasing", "Vehicle pickup", "Parts pickup and delivery", "Special-order parts", "Auto recycling"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Auto repair", "Vehicle recycling", "Salvage"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["No-cost pickup for unwanted vehicles", "Special-order parts service", "Service area covering King and Pierce counties", "Purchases cars and trucks of all makes and models", "Continuous inventory updates"], "facts_used": ["Location: 26311 78th Ave S, Kent, WA 98032 -> /", "Formerly AAA Auto Wrecking, now Binford Auto Wrecking -> /about", "Serves Puget Sound for over 30 years -> db", "Sells used auto parts: engines, transmissions, alternators, radiators, wheels, tires -> /", "Buys cars and trucks of all makes and models -> /services", "Offers no-cost pickup for unwanted vehicles -> /services", "Provides parts pickup, delivery, and special-order service -> /services", "Service area: King and Pierce counties -> /about", "Serves individuals, repair shops, and other automotive customers -> /", "Emphasizes ''More value from every vehicle'' -> /"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Binford Auto Wrecking, formerly listed as AAA Auto Wrecking, sells used automotive parts and buys cars and trucks of all makes and models.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='aaa-auto-wrecking' AND approved AND profile