UPDATE companies SET description='American Electric Equipment Inc. (AEEI) and its sister division Control Products Inc. (CPI) have operated from Beckley, West Virginia since 1985. The company is American owned and operated, with roots in mining and underground power distribution, and has expanded into broader industrial and commercial markets over more than 40 years.

The company designs and builds custom dry-type transformers (12,470 V down to 120 V), high-voltage switchgear including the ISOVAC 800 (15 kV, 800 A), ground monitors, power centers, substations, and its own ProVac medium-voltage vacuum circuit breaker. It also reconditions and services Yaskawa SF6 gas circuit breakers (5–15 kV) with factory-trained technicians. An OMAX 120X abrasive waterjet with a 26''8" × 10'' work area provides precision cutting of steel, stainless, aluminum, titanium, composites, glass, and stone for custom brackets, gaskets, plates, and signage. Additional services include Kohler generator sales, sizing, installation, and maintenance; excavation, construction, and demolition; erosion control and site reclamation; and on-site field service and engineering repair.

Primary customers are mining operations and industrial facilities requiring underground power distribution systems, as well as commercial and industrial sites needing standby power. The explosion-proof product line under CPI — enclosures, control stations, and junction boxes — is engineered and certified for hazardous, gassy mining environments.

The company emphasizes its dual-division structure (AEEI electrical equipment plus CPI explosion-proof products), deep mining expertise, and the combination of custom manufacturing with certified field service. It positions itself as a single source for engineered equipment, fabrication, and on-site support, all built and serviced to customer specifications.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom dry-type transformer manufacturing", "High-voltage switchgear design and build (up to 15 kV)", "Ground monitor and fault relay production", "Power center and substation assembly", "Plug, receptacle, and contactor fabrication (300\u2013600 A)", "ProVac medium-voltage vacuum circuit breaker manufacturing", "Explosion-proof enclosure, control station, and junction box fabrication", "Yaskawa SF6 circuit breaker reconditioning and certification", "Kohler generator sales, sizing, installation, and maintenance", "OMAX 120X abrasive waterjet cutting", "In-house and on-site metal fabrication", "Breaker repair and transformer servicing", "Field testing and commissioning", "Excavation, construction, and demolition", "Erosion control and site reclamation", "On-site field service and engineering support"], "industries": ["Mining", "Industrial manufacturing", "Commercial standby power", "Underground power distribution"], "materials": ["Steel", "Stainless steel", "Aluminum", "Titanium", "Composites", "Glass", "Stone"], "equipment": ["OMAX 120X abrasive waterjet", "ISOVAC 800 vacuum isolation breaker", "Yaskawa SF6 gas circuit breakers (5\u201315 kV)", "ProVac medium-voltage vacuum circuit breaker", "Kohler standby generators"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["40+ years in operation since 1985", "Dual divisions: AEEI electrical equipment and CPI explosion-proof products", "OMAX 120X waterjet with 26''8\" \u00d7 10'' work area cutting virtually any material", "ISOVAC 800 15 kV/800 A vacuum isolation breaker with 30-second control 