UPDATE companies SET description='Advanced Micro Peripherals Inc serves as the North American sales office for Advanced Micro Peripherals Ltd., a UK-based design and manufacturing company founded in 1993 near Cambridge, England. The U.S. operation is headquartered in New York, New York, and supports industrial and defense customers across the Americas.

